Package: ffmpeg
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Tools for transcoding, streaming and playing of multimedia files
 FFmpeg is the leading multimedia framework, able to decode, encode, transcode,
 mux, demux, stream, filter and play pretty much anything that humans and
 machines have created.
 .
 This package contains:
  * ffmpeg: a command line tool to convert multimedia files between formats
  * ffprobe: a simple multimedia stream analyzer
  * qt-faststart: a utility to move the moov atom of a QuickTime/MP4 file to
    the front, so that it plays over HTTP while it is still downloading
 .
 This build has no X11 support, no optical disc support, no DVB tuner
 support and no VDPAU acceleration; ffplay is not built at all. See
 README.md in the crick Debian backports repository.
 .
 No manual pages are shipped: the documentation is not built.

Package: libavcodec63
Architecture: any
Section: libs
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: FFmpeg library with de/encoders for audio/video codecs - runtime files
 FFmpeg is the leading multimedia framework, able to decode, encode, transcode,
 mux, demux, stream, filter and play pretty much anything that humans and
 machines have created.
 .
 This library provides a generic encoding/decoding framework and contains
 multiple decoders and encoders for audio, video and subtitle streams, and
 several bitstream filters.
 .
 This package contains the runtime files.

