Package: libavutil61
Architecture: any
Section: libs
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: FFmpeg library with utility functions - runtime files
 FFmpeg is the leading multimedia framework, able to decode, encode, transcode,
 mux, demux, stream, filter and play pretty much anything that humans and
 machines have created.
 .
 This library is a utility library to aid portable multimedia programming. It
 contains safe portable string functions, random number generators, data
 structures, additional mathematics functions, cryptography and multimedia
 related functionality (like enumerations for pixel and sample formats).
 .
 This package contains the runtime files.

